      "id": 238655,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-06-22T15:54:55.465Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"28621\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Huh, I didn’t know there was a Freedom Four during the Revolutionary War . . .</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It’s Disparation so timeline wise it doesn’t have to make sense.   Really the only hero I expect to be the direct line to Legacy is Joseph Parsons.   Beyond that I’m not sure who will be used for a 1776 Tachyon, Bunker, or Wraith.</p>",
