      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-06-23T11:54:15.758Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Haka was already in a Freedom Four, so he seems like a shoe-in.  Most likely everyone would assume him to have been one of the allied Native American tribes, not knowing what a Maori was.  He most likely replaces Tachyon, since she’s the hardest to justify in a Revolutionary War context, being so much a creature of modern science (plus we’ve seen a Freedom Five without her before, but not one without Wraith).</p>",
